## Third-party Licenses

pickal uses several third-party libraries, each with its own license:

### Dependencies

| Library | License | Purpose |
|---------|---------|---------|
| cyclopts | MIT | CLI framework |
| pydantic-settings | MIT | Configuration management |
| rich | MIT | Rich formatting and logging |
| pytest | MIT | Testing framework |
| ruff | MIT | Linting and formatting |
| mypy | MIT | Type checking |
| uv | MIT | Package management |

### License Compatibility

All third-party licenses are compatible with the MIT license and allow for commercial use, modification, and distribution.

## Contribution License Agreement

By contributing to pickal, you agree that your contributions will be licensed under the MIT License.

